1
00:01:05,247 --> 00:01:08,920
[Episode 3]

2
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,480
The 25th day of the third lunar month,

3
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,640
eight bowls of steamed balls with pine nuts,

4
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:15,900
Ten taels.

5
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,780
Master, your tea.

6
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:30,180
Take a break and have some tea.

7
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:37,219
I calculated everything you just read.
Take a look.

8
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,980
So fast?

9
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,719
It smells nice, yet tasteless.

10
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,239
It's not good.

11
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:53,019
Rich aroma, delicate flavor,

12
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:55,719
silky and mellow on the palate.

13
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:59,060
This is Huiyuan Tea. A hundred taels per jin.

14
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:04,260
They spared no expense
to win over a goose like you.

15
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,819
Are you listening?

16
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,900
Someone, come.

17
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:06,199
It's getting late.

18
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:08,219
Escort her back to rest.

19
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,659
See that she has a thicker quilt,
lest she catches cold.

20
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,379
Lady Jin.

21
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,039
Lady Jin.

22
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:27,840
A concubine may not lodge
in her lord's chamber overnight.

23
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,539
Let us help you back.

24
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,639
Ying Tao!

25
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:57,340
Fetch charcoal powder!

26
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,060
Jin Bao Zhu!

27
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:41,339
You...

28
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:46,160
I finally figured it out.

29
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:49,079
My hands would catch fire
with all this rubbing.

30
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,660
Is it so exaggerated?

31
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:57,720
Master Yan, Lady Jin.

32
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:00,540
Now that we've tallied the accounts,

33
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,399
- shall we report back?
- For what?

34
00:05:03,399 --> 00:05:06,945
No, it is time to settle our debts.

35
00:05:06,945 --> 00:05:10,040
[Lu Mansion]

36
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:12,639
I am a younger member of the Xie family.

37
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:14,399
I sent a visiting card the other day,

38
00:05:14,399 --> 00:05:16,839
specifically to borrow the book,
Jingyue Works.

39
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:19,779
I've been swamped lately,
and I completely forgot.

40
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:22,339
May I ask your name?

41
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:26,399
High mountains we revere;
great virtues we follow.

42
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,399
[Song Jing Xing]
That's where my name, Jing Xing,

43
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:29,279
[Shen Man Yun's Adopted Son]
comes from.

44
00:05:29,279 --> 00:05:32,959
I remember all young men of the Xie family
bear one-character given names.

45
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,319
My surname is Song.

46
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:36,720
I was a distant relative of Lady Xie.

47
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,639
I'm staying with the Xie family to study

48
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,279
for next year's imperial physician exam.

49
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:42,079
So you're just living under another's roof.

50
00:05:42,079 --> 00:05:44,040
How dare you
call yourself a Xie family member!

51
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,319
Imperial physician exam?

52
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,819
You think much too highly of yourself.

53
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:51,399
Why are you mocking him?

54
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,959
He didn't lie.

55
00:05:52,959 --> 00:05:54,639
He is of humble origin.

56
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:56,720
His diligence is praiseworthy.

57
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:59,399
Let's go. Don't mind them.

58
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:01,199
A family elder is sick.

59
00:06:01,199 --> 00:06:02,839
My healing art is shallow.

60
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:05,759
I have no one else to turn to,
so I came to beg the book from your manor.

61
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:09,519
Please, Master Lu,
show some mercy and grant me this favor.

62
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:11,639
The Xie family has immense wealth.

63
00:06:11,639 --> 00:06:13,759
What kind of physician could they not afford?

64
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:15,819
Since when is it your place to get involved?

65
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:20,839
This book was written by the best physician,
Zhang Jing Yue.

66
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:23,959
Countless physicians exhausted their fortunes
and connections for a copy,

67
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:25,519
only to return empty-handed.

68
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:27,759
You think you can just have it
whenever you want?

69
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:29,779
[Jingyue Works]
You think it's as cheap as turnips?

70
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,199
Forget it.

71
00:06:35,199 --> 00:06:40,079
If you can catch Xi's favorite fish today
and make her smile,

72
00:06:40,079 --> 00:06:43,819
no need to borrow it,
I'll give it to you outright.

73
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:45,839
Good idea.

74
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:47,600
Let him catch the fish.

75
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,600
Make him catch fish!

76
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:51,040
Lu Zi Yu, are you out of your mind?

77
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,519
It's freezing cold.
Do you want to freeze him to death?

78
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:55,519
Xi, I'm not bullying him.

79
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:57,759
He's willing to do it. Ask him yourself.

80
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,259
Isn't that right?

81
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:04,259
For Master Lu, if I may make Miss Xi smile,
I would gladly do so.

82
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:08,439
Wait, you...

83
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:11,399
Why are you such a coward?

84
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:15,399
Xi, he has to take off his boots
and get in the water.

85
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:17,319
It's improper for a young lady to stay here.

86
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:19,319
Why don't you take a stroll in the garden?

87
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,860
I'll send for you when it's done.

88
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:26,079
What? Are you really taking them off?

89
00:07:26,079 --> 00:07:28,383
- He's really taking them off!
- Look at him!

90
00:07:28,383 --> 00:07:31,079
- Look!
- That one! Go more to that side!

91
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:33,439
- Yes!
- Over there! See it?

92
00:07:33,439 --> 00:07:34,939
It's right there!

93
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,240
Exactly! What are you catching?

94
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,360
- No, not that one!
- Do you even know how to catch fish?

95
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:42,420
- That one!
- Hurry up!

96
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:44,759
- Go by yourself!
- Come on!

97
00:07:44,759 --> 00:07:45,759
I'll just wait right here.

98
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:47,079
- Go by yourself!
- Get moving!

99
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,519
I'm waiting right here.

100
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:51,199
When you were fooling around
and piling up debts,

101
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,639
why weren't you embarrassed then?

102
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,160
Now that we're at their doorstep,
you care about your pride?

103
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,319
The world stretches
as wide as rivers and seas.

104
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,639
All you behold is but a single scoop.

105
00:07:56,639 --> 00:07:58,639
What can you possibly know?

106
00:07:58,639 --> 00:08:00,199
Why should I know?

107
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:02,199
You prate lofty nonsense all day,

108
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,600
yet earn not a copper.

109
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,459
What a spoilsport.

110
00:08:06,199 --> 00:08:07,720
- Let's go!
- I'm not going.

111
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,839
Are you going or not?

112
00:08:08,839 --> 00:08:10,339
You go.

113
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:14,339
You're so strong!

114
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,720
Tell your master

115
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:24,279
that Xie Yan, son of the former Director

116
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:27,759
of the Ministry of Revenue's
Canal Shipping Bureau,

117
00:08:27,759 --> 00:08:37,279
comes to claim his debt.

118
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,740
Master.

119
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:51,159
When the clerk of Shuyu Pavilion came
for payment, I checked the ledger carefully.

120
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:52,279
For half a year,

121
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:53,519
- you ran up at least 70 to 80 charges,
- Xi.

122
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,679
all charged

123
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:57,039
to my husband.

124
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:59,399
I calculated them item by item.

125
00:08:59,399 --> 00:09:03,039
You all owe a total of 1,612 taels.

126
00:09:03,039 --> 00:09:04,820
Here is the rough draft I drew up.

127
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:10,120
Sister-in-law,
what on earth did you write here?

128
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,559
Pardon my ignorance,

129
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:13,360
but I can't make heads or tails of this.

130
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:15,259
It's fine. I can't read either.

131
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,279
Who are you anyway?

132
00:09:17,279 --> 00:09:19,039
Why are you calling me sister-in-law?

133
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:21,940
I... I'm your husband's sister.

134
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:24,919
You have a sister?

135
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:26,419
Just a concubine-born sister.

136
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:35,039
These scribbles look like chicken scratch.

137
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:37,039
There aren't even any names on here.

138
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:38,799
How can we accept this?

139
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:40,159
The ledger of Shuyu Pavilion

140
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:42,679
bears clear records of dates,
hours, wine, food and tea treats.

141
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:44,559
It's even stamped with a red seal.

142
00:09:44,559 --> 00:09:47,480
That's how proper businesses keep accounts.

143
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:50,480
I only recognize bills from Shuyu Pavilion.

144
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,045
- Exactly!
- We won't

145
00:09:52,045 --> 00:09:53,317
accept bills from anywhere else.

146
00:09:53,317 --> 00:09:54,578
How could we accept this?

147
00:09:54,578 --> 00:09:56,078
We can't.

148
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:59,279
I brought their ledger too.

149
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:02,799
Not only that,
I also brought proof of your tabs.

150
00:10:02,799 --> 00:10:05,240
If the evidence is solid, will you accept it?

151
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,519
I will.

152
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:08,159
Fine.

153
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:10,279
Draw up a written pledge for me first,
then I shall show you.

154
00:10:10,279 --> 00:10:12,575
Otherwise, I'm going to the magistrate.

155
00:10:12,575 --> 00:10:13,575
The magistrate?

156
00:10:13,575 --> 00:10:15,759
- Report to the magistrate?
- That's his own father!

157
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:17,399
Report to the magistrate?

158
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:20,299
Fine, I'll have someone write it.

159
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:25,559
Call that guy over.

160
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:27,059
Understood.

161
00:10:34,879 --> 00:10:36,379
Hurry up!

162
00:10:39,519 --> 00:10:42,019
Master Lu, is this the one?

163
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:51,019
I summoned you to write, not to fish!

164
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:54,240
Draft a written pledge quickly.

165
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,559
Don't keep my guest waiting.

166
00:10:55,559 --> 00:10:57,696
[Jingyue Works]

167
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:01,259
Yes.

168
00:11:12,319 --> 00:11:17,539
Write swiftly and well,
and you shall be richly rewarded.

169
00:11:18,519 --> 00:11:20,019
Yes.

170
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,500
Master Lu.

171
00:11:39,989 --> 00:11:41,504
[Written Pledge]

172
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:55,039
[Puji Temple Ordination Certificate]

173
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:57,039
What kind of proof is this?

174
00:11:57,039 --> 00:12:00,879
On the 11th day of the third lunar month,
he copied scriptures at Puji Temple.

175
00:12:00,879 --> 00:12:03,799
This is the temple's ordination certificate,
sealed by the abbot.

176
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:06,159
[Puji Temple]
This is the ordination certificate,

177
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:08,059
[Guest Monk, the 11th Day of the Third Month]
sealed by the abbot.

178
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:11,799
Remember this:
on the 9th day of the sixth lunar month...

179
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,919
[Medical Record]
On the 9th day of the sixth lunar month,

180
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:14,919
his old leg wound flared,
confining him to bed.

181
00:12:14,919 --> 00:12:16,879
Here is the prescription written
by the physician that day.

182
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:19,519
Seventh lunar month, 23rd, he visited
Imperial Hospital for a return consultation.

183
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:21,000
[Imperial Hospital]
This is the receipt from the hospital,

184
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:23,039
[Patient: Xie Yan]
signed by the imperial physician.

185
00:12:23,039 --> 00:12:24,759
My husband was absent then,

186
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:27,039
yet the accounts bore his name.

187
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,740
How do you explain that?

188
00:12:29,519 --> 00:12:31,059
What's the rush?

189
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:35,419
I shall first
examine Shuyu Pavilion's ledgers.

190
00:12:52,559 --> 00:12:54,399
Strange.

191
00:12:54,399 --> 00:12:58,779
None of the dates you spoke of are here.

192
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,360
Could someone have torn them out?

193
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,980
What nonsense!

194
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,220
You dared to do it,
yet refuse to own up to it?

195
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:22,139
How ridiculous.

196
00:13:22,879 --> 00:13:24,519
Just own up to it.

197
00:13:24,519 --> 00:13:25,559
Exactly.

198
00:13:25,559 --> 00:13:27,059
You will not even confess it.

199
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:31,299
Just admit it. It's fine.

200
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,120
What's the big deal?

201
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,899
You had to make a fool of yourself.

202
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,519
Embarrassing, isn't it?

203
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:47,639
Could it be that your husband
cannot settle his debts?

204
00:13:47,639 --> 00:13:51,159
You secretly tore out those pages,

205
00:13:51,159 --> 00:13:54,960
hoping to extort payment
from us on his behalf?

206
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,879
That actually makes sense!

207
00:13:56,879 --> 00:13:58,620
That's definitely it!

208
00:14:00,679 --> 00:14:03,519
Then she may lay claim
to any sum she pleases!

209
00:14:03,519 --> 00:14:05,039
She's got some nerve!

210
00:14:05,039 --> 00:14:06,639
Trying to extort us?

211
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:08,240
Doesn't she know who we are?

212
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:10,519
Exactly! Who do you think you are?

213
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:12,320
She even dared to threaten reporting
to the authorities!

214
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,320
How insolent of her!

215
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,720
Isn't she just trying to frame us?

216
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,480
That's the thief crying "Stop thief!"

217
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,539
What did we ever do to you?

218
00:14:24,039 --> 00:14:25,519
They were indeed torn out.

219
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:27,360
No records remain of those days.

220
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,639
Exactly.

221
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,879
See?

222
00:14:29,879 --> 00:14:32,399
Cheng Jiang is reasonable.

223
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:36,179
Since there are no records,
there's no need to settle the accounts, no?

224
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:41,200
Cheng Jiang, they may leave?

225
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,519
Let's leave.

226
00:14:42,519 --> 00:14:43,519
Gentlemen, I'll walk you out.

227
00:14:43,519 --> 00:14:45,620
Fortunately, I have a decent memory.

228
00:14:46,919 --> 00:14:50,759
I kept track of everything
when I checked the accounts for her.

229
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:53,039
I will recite them now.

230
00:14:53,039 --> 00:14:55,220
Just have someone write them down.

231
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,980
Cheng Jiang,

232
00:14:58,639 --> 00:15:01,279
it's not that I don't trust you,

233
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:05,639
but if you get the numbers wrong,
none of us would know, right?

234
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:09,000
- Exactly.
- Then summon a few more accountants.

235
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:13,039
We can see if the numbers match the total.

236
00:15:13,039 --> 00:15:16,620
If they match,
it proves I'm not making it up.

237
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:22,519
Over such a trivial matter,
why make such a fuss, Cheng Jiang?

238
00:15:22,519 --> 00:15:26,519
I am settling the accounts
precisely to clear your name.

239
00:15:26,519 --> 00:15:29,620
Don't you understand my good intentions?

240
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:45,399
Fetch a few clever accountants.

241
00:15:45,399 --> 00:15:48,259
Make sure to find errors in their figures.

242
00:15:48,919 --> 00:15:52,220
Refute these two,
and they'll be handsomely rewarded.

243
00:15:52,879 --> 00:15:54,379
Understood.

244
00:15:57,879 --> 00:16:00,159
The 11th day of the third lunar month:
four servings of Liu'an Tea,

245
00:16:00,159 --> 00:16:02,399
eight pots of apricot blossom wine,
four bowls of silver fish soup.

246
00:16:02,399 --> 00:16:05,200
Entertainer Qing Lian performed,
singing four verses of Silver Threads.

247
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,240
Total: 56 taels.

248
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,399
The 9th day of the lunar month:

249
00:16:07,399 --> 00:16:09,279
eight pine nut cakes, eight walnut pastries.

250
00:16:09,279 --> 00:16:11,759
Entertainer Qing Lian performed,
singing two verses of Cleaving Jade.

251
00:16:11,759 --> 00:16:12,879
Total: 48 taels.

252
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,039
The 23rd day of the seventh lunar month:

253
00:16:14,039 --> 00:16:16,559
three cups of Mengding tea,
three bowls of fresh bamboo shoot soup.

254
00:16:16,559 --> 00:16:19,879
Entertainer Mei Ling performed,
singing five verses of The Fifth Watch.

255
00:16:19,879 --> 00:16:21,879
Total: 64 taels.

256
00:16:21,879 --> 00:16:23,799
That is all.

257
00:16:23,799 --> 00:16:25,159
Well?

258
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:29,620
Do the figures match the total or not?

259
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:33,399
The 11th day of the third lunar month:
eight pots of apricot blossom wine.

260
00:16:33,399 --> 00:16:35,879
Sixteen taels means two taels per pot.

261
00:16:35,879 --> 00:16:38,639
Yet as it stands,
the wine costs one string of coins per pot.

262
00:16:38,639 --> 00:16:40,559
Four pots should only cost four taels.

263
00:16:40,559 --> 00:16:42,399
You overcharged by a full 12 taels!

264
00:16:42,399 --> 00:16:44,240
In the third and fourth lunar months,
apricot blossoms are in full bloom.

265
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,919
More people drink apricot blossom wine,

266
00:16:45,919 --> 00:16:47,639
yet apricot blossoms were scarce this year.

267
00:16:47,639 --> 00:16:49,159
Naturally, the price was higher.

268
00:16:49,159 --> 00:16:50,759
Now that it's cold, nobody drinks it,

269
00:16:50,759 --> 00:16:52,200
so it's gotten cheaper.

270
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,679
No tea was ordered
on the 9th day of the sixth lunar month.

271
00:16:54,679 --> 00:16:57,200
The courtesan asked four strings per verse,
singing two verses.

272
00:16:57,200 --> 00:17:00,039
Snacks cost 32 taels, totaling 40.

273
00:17:00,039 --> 00:17:02,519
Where does this 48 taels come from?

274
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:03,799
When you sit at a teahouse,

275
00:17:03,799 --> 00:17:05,200
you pay for the seats
even if you don't drink.

276
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,039
Did you expect to sit there for free?

277
00:17:07,039 --> 00:17:09,079
One tael per person,
eight taels for eight people.

278
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:10,160
It adds up perfectly.

279
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,599
The 23rd day of the seventh lunar month:

280
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:14,960
three servings of Mengding tea,
four strings apiece, 12 taels total.

281
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:18,000
Three bowls of bamboo shoot soup,
two strings apiece, six taels total.

282
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,599
Five verses sung by the courtesan
cost 20 taels.

283
00:17:20,599 --> 00:17:24,279
That's 38 taels in total, not 64 taels!

284
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:27,200
Mei Ling is Shuyu Pavilion's top courtesan.

285
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:30,319
Could her songs possibly
cost the same as Qing Lian's?

286
00:17:30,319 --> 00:17:32,759
She charges eight taels per verse.

287
00:17:32,759 --> 00:17:36,000
Five verses make 40 taels.

288
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:38,920
Alas, no matter how well Mei Ling sings,
her talent goes to waste.

289
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:42,240
Someone has engaged Qing Lian
for four to five months in succession.

290
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:44,799
It seems Qing Lian
is Master Lu's true darling.

291
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:46,400
Cease these baseless accusations!

292
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:49,000
Xi, Qing Lian has had a tragic life.

293
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:50,359
I was merely helping her out.

294
00:17:50,359 --> 00:17:53,279
Enough! Helping her is no concern of mine.

295
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:56,359
Accountant, keep questioning them!
Why did you stop?

296
00:17:56,359 --> 00:17:58,240
I have finished verifying the figures.

297
00:17:58,240 --> 00:18:01,000
Master Xie's accounts are entirely correct.

298
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,359
They match the total sum perfectly.

299
00:18:03,359 --> 00:18:05,359
How is that possible?
How could an ordinary man...

300
00:18:05,359 --> 00:18:07,880
An ordinary man indeed could not.

301
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,380
But I can.

302
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,339
Xi!

303
00:18:19,119 --> 00:18:20,119
Pay up.

304
00:18:20,119 --> 00:18:21,599
Go ask them to repay you.

305
00:18:21,599 --> 00:18:23,000
I am not the only one indebted to you.

306
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,000
You arranged every outing.
Naturally, I demand you make restitution.

307
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:27,599
As for their portion, go collect it yourself.

308
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:30,079
This isn't a small sum.

309
00:18:30,079 --> 00:18:31,579
Give me some time to gather it.

310
00:18:39,920 --> 00:18:41,420
Three days.

311
00:18:42,119 --> 00:18:45,740
Three days hence, I shall repay every coin.

312
00:18:59,039 --> 00:19:00,599
A woman's virtue rests in poise and demeanor,

313
00:19:00,599 --> 00:19:02,579
grave and modest in bearing before others.

314
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,740
Where does a man's virtue rest?

315
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,759
In his heart.

316
00:19:09,759 --> 00:19:10,920
So in a cur's belly.

317
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:11,920
Jin Bao Zhu.

318
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:13,519
What?

319
00:19:13,519 --> 00:19:15,759
I spoke myself hoarse in your defense.

320
00:19:15,759 --> 00:19:17,519
So what if I jabbed at you a little?

321
00:19:17,519 --> 00:19:19,759
Besides, don't you know how to read?

322
00:19:19,759 --> 00:19:21,440
Why did you make me memorize the receipts?

323
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,420
You just thought
collecting debts was humiliating.

324
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,500
Give me the written pledge.

325
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:40,599
You've been tricked.

326
00:19:40,599 --> 00:19:43,079
There's neither signature
nor fingerprint on this.

327
00:19:43,079 --> 00:19:44,759
He took advantage of your illiteracy
to deceive you.

328
00:19:44,759 --> 00:19:48,259
You probably won't get this money back.

329
00:19:58,759 --> 00:20:00,920
It's fine. It's not your fault.

330
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:03,400
Of course, it's not my fault!

331
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,960
I don't need your pity.

332
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:06,960
When they tricked me for being illiterate,
you didn't defend me.

333
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,279
You were the one supposed
to check this in the first place.

334
00:20:08,279 --> 00:20:10,160
- Why didn't you look at it?
- I'm looking at it now.

335
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:12,640
You wipe your nose
only when the mucus runs into your mouth?

336
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:14,279
It's way too late!

337
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:16,240
I recited the accounts for you just now.

338
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:18,319
You've scolded me enough.

339
00:20:18,319 --> 00:20:19,819
What more do you want?

340
00:20:36,039 --> 00:20:39,319
I was mocked for clearing your troubles.

341
00:20:39,319 --> 00:20:41,000
You must make amends.

342
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:44,339
That's only fair, right?

343
00:20:55,559 --> 00:20:57,319
- Jin Bao Zhu!
- Go on!

344
00:20:57,319 --> 00:20:59,200
- Come here!
- No, I'm not going!

345
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:01,680
- Jin Bao Zhu!
- Go on!

346
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:03,180
I'll divorce you!

347
00:21:06,039 --> 00:21:09,339
Cheng Jiang, what are you doing here?

348
00:21:16,130 --> 00:21:17,990
Where is your shrewish wife?

349
00:21:17,990 --> 00:21:19,579
Did she plaster you to the ground?

350
00:21:21,421 --> 00:21:23,259
You're henpecked, huh?

351
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:25,759
My apologies.

352
00:21:25,759 --> 00:21:26,839
It's all because of...

353
00:21:26,839 --> 00:21:28,339
You, get over here.

354
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,079
That man is wholly to blame.

355
00:21:32,079 --> 00:21:33,940
He kept pestering me for that medical book.

356
00:21:35,759 --> 00:21:37,779
You scribbled gibberish!

357
00:21:38,559 --> 00:21:40,559
Watch this, Cheng Jiang.

358
00:21:40,559 --> 00:21:43,519
I'll kick him good for you.

359
00:21:43,519 --> 00:21:45,180
I'll kick you to death!

360
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:49,799
How dare you
play petty tricks on Cheng Jiang!

361
00:21:49,799 --> 00:21:52,839
Don't you know
you and I are just ordinary folks?

362
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:54,440
Is Cheng Jiang ordinary?

363
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,960
No, he's not!

364
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:59,660
He's the prodigy of Yangzhou,
parading on horseback through the streets!

365
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,500
Who hit me?

366
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:10,539
- Who was that?
- Me, you wretch!

367
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,640
How dare you!

368
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:17,220
I'm the son of the River Sub-Prefect!

369
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:19,279
Men!

370
00:22:19,279 --> 00:22:21,079
- Yes!
- Get her!

371
00:22:21,079 --> 00:22:22,579
Yes!

372
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:29,960
You have no honor left.

373
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:32,240
Why should I seek to shame you?

374
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:34,720
No wonder my husband's sister
looks down on you.

375
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:36,519
Take a good look in the mirror!

376
00:22:36,519 --> 00:22:39,279
Spout nonsense to my husband again,
and I'll beat you to death!

377
00:22:39,279 --> 00:22:40,880
And another thing!

378
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:43,200
How dare you trick me!

379
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:46,039
Sign and stamp your thumbprint right now!

380
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:47,960
Sign it!

381
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:49,599
Sign!

382
00:22:49,599 --> 00:22:51,279
Cheng Jiang, stop her!

383
00:22:51,279 --> 00:22:54,220
If she hits me again,
I won't even be able to sign!

384
00:23:01,092 --> 00:23:03,960
[Written Pledge]

385
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:17,420
Stamp your thumbprint!

386
00:23:21,153 --> 00:23:23,683
[Pledged by Lu Zi Yu]

387
00:23:33,119 --> 00:23:34,700
Be careful.

388
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:40,039
I saw you the day of the tea ceremony.

389
00:23:40,039 --> 00:23:41,799
You felt the matriarch's pulse.

390
00:23:41,799 --> 00:23:43,980
Out of respect for her,
I'm returning this to you.

391
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,000
Thank you.

392
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:50,819
Trick me again, and I'll beat you up too.

393
00:24:23,599 --> 00:24:25,180
It's snowing.

394
00:24:30,599 --> 00:24:32,759
Did you receive the betrothal gifts?

395
00:24:32,759 --> 00:24:34,119
Yes, I did.

396
00:24:34,119 --> 00:24:38,119
Yet most shall pass to my father's main wife
and my younger brother.

397
00:24:38,119 --> 00:24:40,119
I could have fought to get them back
for my mother,

398
00:24:40,119 --> 00:24:42,200
but I wanted her to learn a lesson.

399
00:24:42,200 --> 00:24:44,180
I shall never outwit a merchant.

400
00:24:45,279 --> 00:24:46,920
That's because you're too stupid.

401
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:48,886
You idle with pampered youths all day,

402
00:24:48,886 --> 00:24:51,839
mocked and preyed upon.

403
00:24:51,839 --> 00:24:53,440
What harm to let them run up a score?

404
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:55,119
As the debt mounts,

405
00:24:55,119 --> 00:24:57,200
we may claim repayment in due time.

406
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:59,119
Yet you insisted on meddling.

407
00:24:59,119 --> 00:25:00,839
Right now, it's barely 1,000 taels.

408
00:25:00,839 --> 00:25:02,940
At worst, his father shall only beat him.

409
00:25:07,119 --> 00:25:08,700
What a pity.

410
00:25:14,319 --> 00:25:16,680
I didn't realize you hold such a grudge.

411
00:25:16,680 --> 00:25:18,240
Settling all old scores.

412
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,519
Aren't you the same?

413
00:25:19,519 --> 00:25:20,720
What?

414
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,539
Settling all old scores.

415
00:25:23,559 --> 00:25:25,059
What does that mean?

416
00:25:26,519 --> 00:25:28,259
Get me that twig.

417
00:25:46,182 --> 00:25:48,759
[Ya Zi Bi Bao]

418
00:25:48,759 --> 00:25:51,519
"Ya" is the eye socket.
"Zi" is the corner of the eye.

419
00:25:51,519 --> 00:25:52,960
At first, it meant to glare at someone.

420
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:54,839
Now it speaks of even the smallest wrong,

421
00:25:54,839 --> 00:25:59,079
and how every grudge, big or small,
must be settled.

422
00:25:59,079 --> 00:26:02,140
Then what about my name?

423
00:26:04,148 --> 00:26:06,360
Your name?

424
00:26:06,360 --> 00:26:07,640
Watch.

425
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:09,140
Jin.

426
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:17,779
Bao.

427
00:26:21,519 --> 00:26:23,019
Zhu.

428
00:26:25,982 --> 00:26:28,539
"Zhu" means "swine",
an animal to be slaughtered?

429
00:26:29,599 --> 00:26:31,640
Not anymore.

430
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:33,140
Then what is it?

431
00:26:46,609 --> 00:26:49,680
[Pearl]

432
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:53,559
From now on, it means the "pearl",
a treasure to be cherished.

433
00:26:53,559 --> 00:26:55,440
What?

434
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:56,940
A treasure to be cherished.

435
00:27:00,200 --> 00:27:02,079
It refers to the jewelry.

436
00:27:02,079 --> 00:27:04,779
I like this one! I love its meaning!

437
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:11,119
Xie Yan,
could you teach me to read and write?

438
00:27:11,119 --> 00:27:13,180
Never again
shall I suffer the mockery of others.

439
00:27:15,119 --> 00:27:17,640
If you teach me, I'll help you too.

440
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,720
How can you help me?

441
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:20,700
I can help you live a better life
in the Xie family.

442
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:28,299
What makes a better life?

443
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:30,119
I don't know.

444
00:27:30,119 --> 00:27:32,279
Yet I know your days are hard.

445
00:27:32,279 --> 00:27:35,599
Our account books were torn,
but we do not know who did it,

446
00:27:35,599 --> 00:27:37,539
nor can we punish the culprit.

447
00:27:38,279 --> 00:27:41,680
Withered grass in your courtyard
grows so tall.

448
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:43,119
Passing the Second Branch's courtyard,

449
00:27:43,119 --> 00:27:45,539
I saw their grounds heavy with blossoms.

450
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:48,960
Will you teach me?

451
00:27:48,960 --> 00:27:50,539
I learn swiftly.

452
00:27:58,440 --> 00:28:00,980
Yes, I'll teach you.

453
00:28:03,039 --> 00:28:05,180
Wonderful!

454
00:28:06,440 --> 00:28:08,700
- Let's go!
- Slow down.

455
00:28:10,599 --> 00:28:12,039
Slow down.

456
00:28:12,039 --> 00:28:15,559
I'm no longer a swine born to be eaten!

457
00:28:15,559 --> 00:28:17,240
Gently now.

458
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:20,680
- I'm born to be treasured.
- Slow down.

459
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:23,079
I'm born to be treasured.

460
00:28:23,079 --> 00:28:24,740
Slow down.

461
00:28:26,359 --> 00:28:28,220
As you wish.

462
00:28:30,359 --> 00:28:32,359
- Stop running!
- I know I was wrong, Father!

463
00:28:32,359 --> 00:28:34,480
[Dedicated to Public Service]
Don't run! Lu Zi Yu, stop right there!

464
00:28:34,480 --> 00:28:35,519
Do not dare take one more step!

465
00:28:35,519 --> 00:28:36,960
I have settled my portion!

466
00:28:36,960 --> 00:28:38,839
The young men of Bai and Huang clans
spent the most,

467
00:28:38,839 --> 00:28:39,920
with but a little left unpaid.

468
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:41,759
Still remains unpaid?

469
00:28:41,759 --> 00:28:43,519
- Father!
- Stop!

470
00:28:43,519 --> 00:28:44,720
- You wretch!
- Don't worry!

471
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:46,759
Stop right there!

472
00:28:46,759 --> 00:28:48,480
Father, are you unharmed?

473
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,480
Don't worry.

474
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:50,960
I shall assuredly recover the money.

475
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,759
You need not trouble yourself further.

476
00:28:52,759 --> 00:28:54,759
Keep your hands off me!

477
00:28:54,759 --> 00:28:58,799
You wretch!
My yearly stipend is but 800 taels!

478
00:28:58,799 --> 00:28:59,799
[Lu Xian]
Look what you've done!

479
00:28:59,799 --> 00:29:01,864
[River Sub-Prefect of Yangzhou Prefecture]
Spending 1,000 taels of silver

480
00:29:01,864 --> 00:29:02,864
just to settle the debts!

481
00:29:02,864 --> 00:29:05,599
If word of this reaches outsiders,

482
00:29:05,599 --> 00:29:07,440
how can they not suspect me?

483
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:10,920
How could I
have fathered such a wretched boy as you?

484
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,359
At times,

485
00:29:12,359 --> 00:29:13,720
I long to strike my own face!

486
00:29:13,720 --> 00:29:15,319
Father!

487
00:29:15,319 --> 00:29:16,799
Rest easy.

488
00:29:16,799 --> 00:29:20,319
Like father, like son. Vermin breeds vermin!

489
00:29:20,319 --> 00:29:21,480
Say that again?

490
00:29:21,480 --> 00:29:23,039
Say that again!

491
00:29:23,039 --> 00:29:24,200
Not again! Father!

492
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:25,880
Stop right there!

493
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:27,440
Father!

494
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:29,420
[Xie Manor]
Stop chasing me, Father!

495
00:29:33,559 --> 00:29:35,059
Ying Tao.

496
00:29:35,799 --> 00:29:37,299
Ying Tao.

497
00:29:38,599 --> 00:29:40,720
What can I do for you, Lady Jin?

498
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:44,279
How do the scions of the Xie family
live in comfort,

499
00:29:44,279 --> 00:29:46,119
enjoy fine food and clad in gold and silver?

500
00:29:46,119 --> 00:29:47,960
That depends on their rank title.

501
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:50,039
The higher their rank, the better their life.

502
00:29:50,039 --> 00:29:51,759
Rank title? What's that?

503
00:29:51,759 --> 00:29:54,279
The Xie clan has over 300 members.

504
00:29:54,279 --> 00:29:56,119
There are innumerable affairs to attend to.

505
00:29:56,119 --> 00:29:57,599
For orderly governance,

506
00:29:57,599 --> 00:29:59,960
duties fall into 16 divisions.

507
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:01,680
Each division has a steward,

508
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:04,200
ranked by task gravity and urgency.

509
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:06,701
Their rank is set by 16 characters:
Heaven, Earth, Dark, Yellow,

510
00:30:06,701 --> 00:30:08,443
Yu, Zhou, Hong, Huang,

511
00:30:08,443 --> 00:30:10,759
Sun, Moon, Wax, Wane, Chen, Xiu, Lie, Zhang.

512
00:30:10,759 --> 00:30:12,519
One character is allotted to each steward

513
00:30:12,519 --> 00:30:14,779
for their rank title.

514
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:16,720
Heaven, Earth, Dark, Yellow?

515
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:20,240
These words depict the look
of heaven and earth.

516
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:22,759
Heaven is dark azure,
and the earth is yellow.

517
00:30:22,759 --> 00:30:23,839
Yu, Zhou, Hong, Huang.

518
00:30:23,839 --> 00:30:25,119
"Yu" denotes the six spatial directions.

519
00:30:25,119 --> 00:30:26,599
"Zhou" is all time from antiquity to now.

520
00:30:26,599 --> 00:30:29,240
"Hong Huang" means the primeval chaos
of heaven's first separation from earth.

521
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:31,279
Sun, Moon, Wax, Wane, Chen, Xiu, Lie, Zhang.

522
00:30:31,279 --> 00:30:32,799
It denotes the sun's rise and fall,

523
00:30:32,799 --> 00:30:34,359
the moon's wax and wane,

524
00:30:34,359 --> 00:30:36,759
stars and constellations arrayed
in the firmament.

525
00:30:36,759 --> 00:30:39,759
Ying Tao, you know much!

526
00:30:39,759 --> 00:30:41,400
You honor me, Lady Jin.

527
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:43,759
I tended to the Matriarch day by day

528
00:30:43,759 --> 00:30:45,579
and learned it gradually.

529
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:48,359
By seniority and station,

530
00:30:48,359 --> 00:30:50,799
is the Matriarch the "Heaven"
of the Xie family?

531
00:30:50,799 --> 00:30:52,279
Indeed.

532
00:30:52,279 --> 00:30:54,519
The Matriarch presides
over the clan's canal shipping undertaking.

533
00:30:54,519 --> 00:30:56,519
She is most revered.

534
00:30:56,519 --> 00:30:59,279
What about... my husband?

535
00:30:59,279 --> 00:31:02,119
Master Yan is of the "Huang" rank.

536
00:31:02,119 --> 00:31:04,259
His duty is to compile canonical works.

537
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:07,720
He is ranked eighth. Quite respectable.

538
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:09,480
Though the title sounds a bit bleak.

539
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:11,200
There is more to this matter, Lady Jin.

540
00:31:11,200 --> 00:31:13,279
The conferral of these ranks
adheres to strict rules.

541
00:31:13,279 --> 00:31:15,519
The first eight ranks must be filled
by direct clan kin,

542
00:31:15,519 --> 00:31:18,440
who oversee critical canal shipping
and core manor affairs.

543
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:20,220
So he's at the very bottom?

544
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:24,240
Matron Fang asked you
to report to Grandmother.

545
00:31:24,240 --> 00:31:25,740
Right now.

546
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:33,279
Ying Tao, stay.

547
00:31:33,279 --> 00:31:35,039
I need another hand.

548
00:31:35,039 --> 00:31:36,960
Jian Wei is utterly exhausted these days.

549
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:38,460
So you come lend a hand.

550
00:31:39,519 --> 00:31:40,519
I am not weary.

551
00:31:40,519 --> 00:31:43,019
To serve Master is my blessing.

552
00:31:44,519 --> 00:31:48,299
Why tear pages from the account book then?
